  "editorial": {
    "name": "NPI-Cloud/ui-components",
    "descriptionZh": "NPI 设计系统的 React 实现，块、组件、图标、插画和设计 token 都在一个包里，基于 Tailwind CSS v4，peer 要求 React >=19。仓库是只读镜像，开发在 NPI 的 monorepo 里。",
    "takeawayZh": "拿 NPI 的 token、图标和插画包。",
    "noteZh": "仓库 h1 是 @npicz/ui-components，README 第一段写明它是 The NPI design system as a React component library — blocks, components, icons, illustrations and design tokens，并特别标注 This repository is a read-only mirror. Development happens in the NPI monorepo。Install 一节给 npm install @npicz/ui-components，Peer dependencies 要求 React >=19 与 Tailwind CSS ^4，Usage 里强调要先 @import \"@npicz/ui-components/styles.css\"，理由写在注释里：Tailwind v4 默认只扫描自己的文件。根目录放着 npi-tokens.css、npi-theme.css、styles.css 三个样式入口，Languages 条是 TypeScript 99.2%。",
    "recommendation": null,
    "pricing": "Free",
